@startuml
actor User
participant "Web Client" as Web
participant "Mobile App" as Mobile
participant "Spring Boot Server" as Server

== Generate Challenge ==
Web -> Server: POST /auth/generate-jwt-challenge
Server -> Server: Generate 3 codes\nSelect correct code\nCreate nonce\nGenerate JWT signed with RSA private key\nEmbed correctCode + nonce + expiry in JWT
Server --> Web: Response { JWT, 3 codes, expiry timestamp }

== User Interaction ==
Web -> User: Display 3 codes
User -> Mobile: Select correct code from mobile UI

== Mobile Signing ==
Mobile -> Mobile: Concatenate data:\n"JWT:selectedCode:nonce"
Mobile -> Mobile: Sign data with mobile's private RSA key
Mobile --> Server: POST /auth/verify-jwt-response\n{ JWT, selectedCode, signature, mobilePublicKey }

== Verification ==
Server -> Server: Parse JWT and verify signature using server's public key
Server -> Server: Validate expiry, extract nonce and correctCode
Server -> Server: Verify mobile signature using mobilePublicKey
Server -> Server: Compare selectedCode with correctCode

alt Verification successful
    Server --> Mobile: 200 OK "Verification successful"
else Verification failed
    Server --> Mobile: 400 Bad Request\n"Invalid JWT, Signature, or Code"
end
@enduml
